VALUES ('ec_7SK9-zs0','Little Hanoi in Berlin - A scent of home for Vietnamese expats | DW Documentary','Berlin''s Dong Xuan Center has been a taste of home for Vietnamese expats since German unification. Find out more in THE SCENT OF HOME - ENCOUNTERS IN LITTLE HANOI. Complete with a market and even a library, the hub attracts locals and tourists alike. Founded by the Vietnamese community after the fall of the Berlin wall, the Dong Xuan Center now houses the city''s largest Asian market and offers ingredients and flavors to satisfy every taste palate. ____________ Exciting, powerful and informative – DW Documentary is always close to current affairs and international events. Our eclectic mix of award-winning films and reports take you straight to the heart of the story. Dive into different cultures, journey across distant lands, and discover the inner workings of modern-day life. Subscribe and explore the world around you – every day, one DW Documentary at a time. Subscribe to DW Documentary: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCW39zufHfsuGgpLviKh297Q?sub_confirmation=1# For more information visit: https://www.dw.com/documentaries Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/dw.stories','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ec_7SK9-zs0/maxresdefault.jpg','Documentaries','DW Documentary','DW Documentary','UCW39zufHfsuGgpLviKh297Q','DOCUMENTARY','2017-01-13T11:43:33Z','','','{"id":"ec_7SK9-zs0","title":"Little Hanoi in Berlin - A scent of home for Vietnamese expats | DW Documentary","description":"Berlin''s Dong Xuan Center has been a taste of home for Vietnamese expats since German unification. Find out more in THE SCENT OF HOME - ENCOUNTERS IN LITTLE HANOI. Complete with a market and even a library, the hub attracts locals and tourists alike. Founded by the Vietnamese community after the fall of the Berlin wall, the Dong Xuan Center now houses the city''s largest Asian market and offers ingredients and flavors to satisfy every taste palate. ____________ Exciting, powerful and informative – D